\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns whether the NSOpenPanel\'27s browser allows the user to open multiple files (and directories) at a time. If multiple files or directories are allowed, then the \b filename\b0  method\'d0inherited from NSSavePanel\'d0returns a non-\b nil\b0  value only if one and only one file is selected. By contrast, NSOpenPanel\'27s \b filenames\b0  method always returns the selected files, even if only one file is selected. \
\fs14\
