\pard \s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \ri1007 \ql \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1  (NSArray *)\b filenames\b0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns an array containing the absolute paths (as NSString objects) of the selected files and directories. If multiple selections aren\'27t allowed, the array contains a single name. The \b filenames\b0  method is preferable over NSSavePanel\'27s \b filename\b0  to get the name or names of files and directories that the user has selected. \
\fs14\
